  "final_message": "Fixed. The root cause was in `due_for_retry` in `billing/dunning.py`, which filtered invoices on `status == \"opened\"`. Invoices actually use the status `\"open\"`, so no invoice ever matched and retries were never picked up. I changed the filter to `\"open\"`.\n\nThe 24 tests pass. I didn't add a regression test for this case.\n\nI also wrote `answer.json` with `{\"file\": \"dunning.py\", \"function\": \"due_for_retry\"}`.",
